triage: fix_game: The trace shows the game moves `round` from 1 to 2 and `active_seat` from 1 to 2 before round 1 is played, so seat 2 chooses the lot size in round 1. The rules make seat ((r-1) mod N)+1 active, which is seat 1 in round 1. Because of this off-by-one, the scripted lot sizes and bids never reach the right seats, every bid comes out 0, nobody wins, and all three revealed cards are discarded instead of only the unchosen one.
